WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.367 --> 00:00:02.635
-Hello, and welcome back
to the captain's quarters.

00:00:02.635 --> 00:00:03.769
Last week
was an exciting one here

00:00:03.769 --> 00:00:06.373
as our beloved/reviled
sea captain

00:00:06.373 --> 00:00:10.743
was joined by a new character,
Ira, the Prospect Park duck.

00:00:10.743 --> 00:00:13.446
We posted a Twitter poll
asking if you wanted

00:00:13.446 --> 00:00:16.916
more duck or less duck, and
"more duck" won in a landslide.

00:00:16.916 --> 00:00:19.685
Now if you're wondering what
would have happened this time

00:00:19.685 --> 00:00:22.789
had "other" won, you would have
been treated to a friendship

00:00:22.789 --> 00:00:24.958
between the sea captain
and a street artist's drawing

00:00:24.958 --> 00:00:26.926
of my wife from
when she was a kid.

00:00:26.926 --> 00:00:29.929
-Hello, little girl!
-Wait, what is this?

00:00:29.929 --> 00:00:32.932
-A bit that's gone on too long!

00:00:32.932 --> 00:00:36.169
-But the duck won, so expect to
hear a good deal more from him.

00:00:36.169 --> 00:00:38.371
Hey, how was your weekend?
-Hey, not great.

00:00:38.371 --> 00:00:40.573
A lady in the park yelled at me
for not wearing a mask,

00:00:40.573 --> 00:00:42.508
and I was like, "Excuse me,
have you ever tried getting

00:00:42.508 --> 00:00:44.243
one of those over a bill?"

00:00:44.243 --> 00:00:47.480
Look, it's a stressful time, but
let's try to be nice, okay?

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:49.282
-Well, that's good advice.

00:00:49.282 --> 00:00:51.117
-Not to mention, I went to
dinner the other night,

00:00:51.117 --> 00:00:52.719
and get this, during the entree,
I said,

00:00:52.719 --> 00:00:55.020
"Does anyone know if these
pellets are gluten free?"

00:00:55.020 --> 00:00:57.022
And everybody looked at me
like I was crazy.

00:00:57.022 --> 00:00:58.524
It's like, oh, I'm sorry.

00:00:58.524 --> 00:01:01.760
I happen to have a very delicate
system, okay? Quack!

00:01:01.760 --> 00:01:04.864
-Oh, this guy is brutal!
-And speaking of brutal...

00:01:04.864 --> 00:01:06.399
-Double team segue!
-Double team segue!

00:01:06.399 --> 00:01:08.234
...the president announced
a bunch of meaningless

00:01:08.234 --> 00:01:11.103
and blatantly unconstitutional
executive orders

00:01:11.103 --> 00:01:13.106
in a PR stunt
at his golf course.

00:01:13.106 --> 00:01:15.341
For more on this, it's time
for "A Closer Look."

00:01:15.341 --> 00:01:18.845 line:0%
♪♪

00:01:18.845 --> 00:01:22.248
This weekend really distilled
just how desperate

00:01:22.248 --> 00:01:24.517
President Trump is
as he continues to trail

00:01:24.517 --> 00:01:25.885
Joe Biden in the polls.

00:01:25.885 --> 00:01:28.387
He announced a bunch
of empty executive orders

00:01:28.387 --> 00:01:31.123
at his golf course instead
of negotiating with Congress.

00:01:31.123 --> 00:01:34.394
He said he would permanently cut
the payroll taxes that fund

00:01:34.394 --> 00:01:36.529
Social Security and Medicare
if re-elected,

00:01:36.529 --> 00:01:39.331
there was a Friday night
massacre at the post office

00:01:39.331 --> 00:01:41.000
as part of Trump's
ongoing attempts

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:42.568
to sabotage mail-in voting,

00:01:42.568 --> 00:01:45.371
and we found out
that his White House

00:01:45.371 --> 00:01:47.540
asked the governor
of South Dakota,

00:01:47.540 --> 00:01:50.943
"What's the process
to add additional presidents

00:01:50.943 --> 00:01:52.444
to Mount Rushmore?"

00:01:52.444 --> 00:01:54.814
You guys know Mount Rushmore,
the thing you saw when you were

00:01:54.814 --> 00:01:57.283
7 and then only
in rental car commercials.

00:01:57.283 --> 00:02:00.252
And there is no process
because it's not a thing.

00:02:00.252 --> 00:02:01.521
It's a national monument.

00:02:01.521 --> 00:02:03.789
It's not the wing wall
down at the Wooden Nickel.

00:02:03.789 --> 00:02:05.958
[ Gruff voice ] The process is
you've got to eat 100 hot wings

00:02:05.958 --> 00:02:09.962
in 10 minutes and you've got
to bring your own picture.

00:02:09.962 --> 00:02:12.231
We're not a picture company here
at the Wooden Nickel.

00:02:12.231 --> 00:02:15.434
That's like going to a priest
after mass and asking him,

00:02:15.434 --> 00:02:17.737
"So what's the process for
adding someone to the trinity?

00:02:17.737 --> 00:02:20.206
What if it was like the father,
the son, the holy spirit,

00:02:20.206 --> 00:02:21.540
and the Dan?"

00:02:21.540 --> 00:02:24.410
Actually, that sounds like
a pretty decent idea

00:02:24.410 --> 00:02:26.678
for an early 2000s
screwball comedy

00:02:26.678 --> 00:02:28.080 line:0%
starring Owen Wilson.

00:02:28.080 --> 00:02:30.049 line:0%
[ As Owen Wilson ] I mean,
how can I lead my flock

00:02:30.049 --> 00:02:32.719 line:0%
when I can't even get
my own apartment?

00:02:32.719 --> 00:02:34.420 line:0%
It's weird.

00:02:34.420 --> 00:02:35.788
[ Normal voice ] And if even
if there was a process

00:02:35.788 --> 00:02:38.691
to get on on Mount Rushmore,
I am pretty sure presiding

00:02:38.691 --> 00:02:41.694
over the preventible deaths
of 160,000 Americans

00:02:41.694 --> 00:02:44.463
in the worst economic crash
since The Great Depression

00:02:44.463 --> 00:02:46.432
would be disqualifying.

00:02:46.432 --> 00:02:48.868
That's like asking your boss
at Chipotle

00:02:48.868 --> 00:02:50.837
when you're getting your
employee of the month plaque

00:02:50.837 --> 00:02:53.705
after you get caught
stirring the guacamole

00:02:53.705 --> 00:02:56.108
with your skateboard.
You're never getting it, Brad.

00:02:56.108 --> 00:02:57.710
You're never gonna get your name
on a plaque.

00:02:57.710 --> 00:02:59.345
Besides, I'm pretty sure
the other presidents

00:02:59.345 --> 00:03:01.447
would be weirded out
having Trump next to them.

00:03:01.447 --> 00:03:04.016
They would all scooch over to
one side of the mountain

00:03:04.016 --> 00:03:06.986
like passengers on the F train
after a dude takes a dump.

00:03:06.986 --> 00:03:10.657
"Let's get off at the next stop.
Only 38 blocks to the park."

00:03:10.657 --> 00:03:13.692
The only upside of putting Trump
on Mount Rushmore

00:03:13.692 --> 00:03:15.527
would be picking
the photo to use

00:03:15.527 --> 00:03:17.129
so we could all remember him
accurately.

00:03:17.129 --> 00:03:20.500
Would it be this photo of Trump
coming back from his Tulsa rally

00:03:20.500 --> 00:03:22.301
looking like he just got fired
from his job

00:03:22.301 --> 00:03:24.003
as a door-to-door vacuum
salesman?

00:03:24.003 --> 00:03:25.804
Or maybe one of these photos,

00:03:25.804 --> 00:03:27.807
where he's screaming
like a rabid possum?

00:03:27.807 --> 00:03:29.943
Or how about that one
from the GOP debate

00:03:29.943 --> 00:03:31.110
where he looks like he's farting

00:03:31.110 --> 00:03:32.211
and getting kicked
in the [bleep]

00:03:32.211 --> 00:03:33.579
at the same time?

00:03:33.579 --> 00:03:35.681
Did he fart because he got
kicked in the [bleep]

00:03:35.681 --> 00:03:38.684
or did he get kicked in
the [bleep] because he farted?

00:03:38.684 --> 00:03:40.920
Trump wants to get on
Mount Rushmore,

00:03:40.920 --> 00:03:42.922
but first he has to get past
Joe Biden,

00:03:42.922 --> 00:03:44.724
who he is trailing badly
in the polls.

00:03:44.724 --> 00:03:46.459
And you can tell Trump
is desperate.

00:03:46.459 --> 00:03:49.595
Last week, for example, he once
again pretended he was doing

00:03:49.595 --> 00:03:51.797
a bunch of official events,
but as always,

00:03:51.797 --> 00:03:53.566
turned them into campaign
speeches,

00:03:53.566 --> 00:03:55.067
and at one point, Trump,

00:03:55.067 --> 00:03:57.770
the twice-divorced
serial adulterer

00:03:57.770 --> 00:04:00.707
who doesn't go to church,
thought Second Corinthians

00:04:00.707 --> 00:04:02.341
was called "Two Corinthians"

00:04:02.341 --> 00:04:05.578
and who probably uses a Bible
to hide his "Playboys"

00:04:05.578 --> 00:04:09.382
still said this about
devout Catholic Joe Biden.

00:04:09.382 --> 00:04:13.052
-He is going to do things that
nobody ever would ever think

00:04:13.052 --> 00:04:15.588
even possible because
he's following

00:04:15.588 --> 00:04:18.390
the radical left agenda.

00:04:18.390 --> 00:04:22.628
Take away your guns,
destroy your second amendment,

00:04:22.628 --> 00:04:27.433
no religion, no anything,
hurt the Bible, hurt God.

00:04:27.433 --> 00:04:30.669
He's against God.
He's against guns.

00:04:30.669 --> 00:04:34.106
He's against energy,
our kind of energy.

00:04:34.106 --> 00:04:35.708
-My God,
why does he always talk like

00:04:35.708 --> 00:04:37.977
