Losing...consciousness.

00:04:39.778 --> 00:04:41.580
[ Raspy voice ]
Must stop Luther.

00:04:41.580 --> 00:04:44.049
He's...against God.

00:04:44.049 --> 00:04:46.118
[ Normal voice ] Trying to make
