an ancient Sumerian riddle.

00:04:48.988 --> 00:04:52.424
If man can hurt God, then is
he not more powerful than God?

00:04:52.424 --> 00:04:54.660
And if man is more powerful
than God,

00:04:54.660 --> 00:04:57.997
