00:05:02.968 --> 00:05:05.471
[ As Trump ]
♪ No religion, no anything ♪

00:05:05.471 --> 00:05:09.208
♪ Hurt the Bible, hurt God ♪

00:05:09.208 --> 00:05:10.643
[ Normal voice ]
I know that was all out of tune,

00:05:10.643 --> 00:05:13.646
