didn't have to pay publishing.

00:05:13.646 --> 00:05:16.783
Also, Biden's against energy?
What are you talking about?

00:05:16.783 --> 00:05:20.452
The dude was literally out in
the sun biking over the weekend.

00:05:20.452 --> 00:05:22.988
Biden is like one of those
grandpas you worry about

00:05:22.988 --> 00:05:24.390
