doing too much.

00:05:24.390 --> 00:05:27.093
Grandpa, it's 6:00 a.m., where
are you going with an axe?

00:05:27.093 --> 00:05:29.262
[ Gruff voice ] You can never
have too much firewood, kiddo.

00:05:29.262 --> 00:05:32.097
You, on the other hand, have all
the energy of a beanbag chair

00:05:32.097 --> 00:05:33.800
low on beans.

00:05:33.800 --> 00:05:36.102
So Trump's obviously
very desperate.

00:05:36.102 --> 00:05:38.337
On top of being historically
unpopular,

00:05:38.337 --> 00:05:40.640
