of lying,

00:06:38.464 --> 00:06:40.566
which is saying a lot
since Lance Armstrong

00:06:40.566 --> 00:06:43.569
is also the Lance Armstrong
of lying, and in this election,

00:06:43.569 --> 00:06:45.671
