00:07:15.568 --> 00:07:17.270
Go ahead, please, right here.

00:07:17.270 --> 00:07:19.839
No, no, you are finished.
Go ahead, please.

00:07:19.839 --> 00:07:24.343
Please.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:07:24.343 --> 00:07:26.812
Go ahead.

00:07:26.812 --> 00:07:29.548
Okay, excuse me.
Go ahead, please.

00:07:29.548 --> 00:07:32.651
Okay.
Thank you very much, everybody.

00:07:32.651 --> 00:07:34.186
Thank you very much.

00:07:34.186 --> 00:07:35.988
